# VINTAGE — STAGING
#
# A throwaway Supabase project holding the 150 house accounts and their
# photographs. No real member data is in it, and nothing here can reach
# production.
#
# This file is committed on purpose. The anon key is the publishable key:
# it ships inside the app bundle, so it is public by design, and row-level
# security is what actually guards the data. The service_role key and the
# database password are the secrets, and neither is here or anywhere in
# this repository.
#
# Switch with:  npm run use:staging
